WEBVTT

00:06:27.871 --> 00:06:30.371
It has chosen to produce
all of its electricity

00:06:30.413 --> 00:06:32.829
from renewable sources by 2050,

00:06:32.829 --> 00:06:34.871
and has already passed the halfway mark.

00:06:34.913 --> 00:06:37.954
One of many countries
moving in this direction.

00:06:38.371 --> 00:06:39.913
Thirty years ago,

00:06:39.913 --> 00:06:43.663
powering our economy with renewable
energy was science fiction.

00:06:44.246 --> 00:06:45.413
Ten years ago,

00:06:45.454 --> 00:06:47.204
it was considered too expensive.

00:06:47.246 --> 00:06:49.538
Today, renewable energy costs less

00:06:49.579 --> 00:06:54.704
and creates more jobs than fossil fuels
in many parts of the world,

00:06:54.704 --> 00:06:56.621
and offers the potential to put power,

00:06:56.663 --> 00:06:59.371
quite literally, back with the people.

00:06:59.871 --> 00:07:01.621
I saw this in Kenya.